      "id": "r004",
      "type": "factual",
      "topic": "time-comparison-semantics",
      "content": "created_at/tr_start/tr_end 比较两后端分叉：SQLite 纯文本比较（' ' < 'T' 使 ISO 查询同天全灭、毫秒尾巴使 eq 永不相等），pg 强转 ::timestamp（接受 today 等日期词、非法值 22007 硬错误）。",
      "source": {
        "origin": "sprint-agent",
        "artifact": "#48",
        "connector": null
      },
      "evidence": "tested",
      "status": "active",
      "phase_added": "research",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-01T04:50:01.287Z",
      "conflicts_with": [],
      "resolved_by": null,
      "tags": [
        "#48"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "r005",
      "type": "factual",
      "topic": "time-comparison-semantics",
      "content": "修复采用'共享归一'：engine::timecmp 校验并把绑定值归一到 UTC 毫秒格式，SQLite 侧 strftime 包列、pg 绑归一值再 ::timestamp；裸日期与日期词在两后端统一为 validation 错误。原则：系统内部一律绝对时间戳，相对日期表达在进系统前转换。",
      "source": {
